## Weekly Growth Audit — 2026-07-27

**Headline: best contribution week ever.** The completed week (2026-07-20) delivered 14 comments from 10 distinct humans — 9 of them first-ever contributors — versus 9 comments from essentially 1 human the week before. Last audit's top bets partially shipped and immediately worked: the q567 masking prompt escaped the questions page and now fires on the homepage (18.8% native gate→contribution) and two enneagram-corner posts (15.6% overall). The reactivation_dormant email sequence finally launched after 5 weeks of flagging (50 enrolled, 22% open, 0 clicks so far). Chorus takes jumped 3 → 11 cumulative, including the first organic personality-analysis conversion (robert-pattinson). Still dead upstream: 0 signups (4th straight week), 0 waitlist (9 weeks). Traffic dipped 9% to 3,868 new visitors.

**Biggest leak: anonymous contribution evaporation.** The gate converts 14–19% wherever it's placed, but 9 of the 10 contributing humans are unreachable fingerprints — zero emails captured. The only multi-day returner is the one registered profile (the reactivated 2023 Type-8). Every loop turn dies at the moment of peak engagement because nothing asks for identity after someone contributes. Secondary leak: personality-analysis holds ~64% of traffic (2,584 fingerprints) with no above-fold prompt and exactly one contribution all week.

**Recommended bets (ranked):**
1. **Post-contribution identity capture** — one email field ("get notified when someone answers you") shown right after contribution/reveal. Previously starved for volume; now unblocked. Success: ≥15% of anonymous contributors leave an email and ≥1 returns within 30 days. Guardrail: contribution completion doesn't drop >10%.
2. **Port the proven prompt to personality-analysis above the fold** — 18.8% native on homepage vs ~0.04% on PA, and the robert-pattinson firing proves PA readers will engage when they find the mechanic. Success: ≥1% of PA sessions fire gate→contribution within 30 days (~26/wk vs 1). Guardrail: bounce ≤ +3 pts.
3. **Judge reactivation_dormant on clicks/returns, not opens** — hold the cold/zombie segments until dormant produces ≥1 click or recipient return. Guardrail: unsub <5% (currently 1/51).

